    11	  - SI units for physical quantities in public API docstrings: `"""Particle positions [m], shape [particle_count, 3]."""`. Joint-dependent: `[m or rad]`. Spatial vectors: `[N, N·m]`. Compound arrays: per-component. Skip non-physical fields.
