    39	### Testing guidelines
    40	
    41	- Never call `wp.synchronize()` or `wp.synchronize_device()` right before `.numpy()` on a Warp array. This is redundant as `.numpy()` performs a synchronous device-to-host copy that completes all outstanding work.
    42	
